    description: "Limited field sensitivity: x tainted → x.field, x.method(), x[key] inherit taint. obj.field = tainted → obj.field tainted but obj.other_field not. Aliased refs via assignment chain covered by reaching defs. No indirect aliasing (container.get). Covers CRDT method-chain pattern. See ADR-0017 §7a."  # 1930
